      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report a patient with pelvic pain as a paroxysmal manifestation of multiple sclerosis (MS). This phenomenon has not been described previously; it can lead to diagnostic difficulties. Like other paroxysmal manifestations, it showed a good response to carbamazepine. The literature on paroxysmal manifestations of MS and some possible pathogenic mechanisms are reviewed briefly."},
